---
alwaysApply: true
---

Use pnpm instead of npm or yarn.

The Node package lives in `node/` (`node/package.json`). Always run pnpm with working directory `node/` (or `pnpm --dir node …` from the repo root). Never run `pnpm exec` from the repo root: there is no package.json there, and pnpm walks up into another project on the machine.